IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. BUSINESS-CHARACTERS.
DATA DIVISION. WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 SUBJECT-TEXT PIC X(5) VALUE 'AAAAA'.
01 TALLY-COUNT PIC 99 VALUE 5.
01 DEST PIC X(6) VALUE 'abcdef'.
01 PTR PIC 99 VALUE 2.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 INSPECT SUBJECT-TEXT TALLYING TALLY-COUNT FOR ALL 'AA'
 INSPECT SUBJECT-TEXT REPLACING FIRST 'AA' BY 'BB'
 STRING 'X,Y' DELIMITED BY ',' 'Z' DELIMITED BY SIZE
 INTO DEST POINTER PTR
 ON OVERFLOW DISPLAY 'OVERFLOW'
 NOT ON OVERFLOW DISPLAY 'NORMAL'
 END-STRING
 DISPLAY SUBJECT-TEXT TALLY-COUNT DEST PTR
 GOBACK.
